WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.405
Module two. Vendor application, aur KYC.

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:12.424
Is module mein hum vendor application ko aaram se, ek ek field karke dekhenge.

3
00:00:12.874 --> 00:00:15.306
Apply to sell form ke chhah steps.

4
00:00:15.756 --> 00:00:20.087
Har field ka matlab kya hai, aur system use kaise check karta hai.

5
00:00:20.537 --> 00:00:23.971
Vendor ko kaun se documents upload karne hain.

6
00:00:24.421 --> 00:00:27.821
Aur wo common mistakes jinse approval late hota hai.

7
00:00:27.821 --> 00:00:33.312
Agar aap vendors ko ye form bharne mein help karte hain, toh ye module aapke liye hi

8
00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:33.573
Hai.

9
00:00:35.967 --> 00:00:40.064
Naya vendor, vendor link kholke Apply to sell pe click karta hai.

10
00:00:40.064 --> 00:00:45.044
Form mein chhah steps hain, aur agar papers ready hon toh lagbhag paanch minute

11
00:00:45.044 --> 00:00:45.738
Lagte hain.

12
00:00:46.188 --> 00:00:47.894
Ek, business details.

13
00:00:48.344 --> 00:00:50.456
Do, authorised signatory.

14
00:00:50.906 --> 00:00:53.018
Teen, banking, payouts ke liye.

15
00:00:53.468 --> 00:00:54.748
Chaar, warehouse.

16
00:00:55.198 --> 00:00:57.310
Paanch, jo categories bechni hain.

17
00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:01.536
Aur chhah, documents. Phir wo KYC confirm karte hain.

18
00:01:03.933 --> 00:01:06.216
Step one hai business details.

19
00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:12.689
Legal business name. Vendors ko boliye ki ye bilkul vaisa hi likhein jaisa unke GST

20
00:01:12.689 --> 00:01:14.068
Certificate pe hai.

21
00:01:14.518 --> 00:01:19.062
Entity type, jaise private limited, partnership ya proprietorship.

22
00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:22.094
Business PAN aur GSTIN.

23
00:01:22.544 --> 00:01:27.642
CIN, jo companies ke paas hota hai, aur business kis saal shuru hua thaa.

24
00:01:28.092 --> 00:01:29.778
Aur registered address.

25
00:01:32.167 --> 00:01:34.812
Chaliye ise live demo mein dekhte hain.

26
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:43.091
Ye raha asli form. Left side pe dikh raha hai ki ye six mein se step one hai:

27
00:01:43.091 --> 00:01:43.709
Business.

28
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.233
Sabse pehle legal business name, phir entity type.

29
00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:55.272
Demo mein Private Limited select kiya gaya hai.

30
00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:08.349
Uske baad PAN, GSTIN aur CIN, aur year established.

31
00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:22.390
GSTIN ke neeche red message dekhiye. Format galat hai, isliye form bata raha hai ki

32
00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:25.224
Sahi fifteen character format kya hai.

33
00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:39.748
Aur yahan doosra check. Is GSTIN se ek vendor pehle se registered hai.

34
00:02:39.748 --> 00:02:43.997
Oribrix pe ek GSTIN sirf ek baar use ho sakta hai.

35
00:02:54.600 --> 00:03:00.022
Toh GSTIN ke do checks yaad rakhiye. Ye sahi format mein fifteen characters ka hona

36
00:03:00.022 --> 00:03:05.249
Chahiye, aur kisi doosre vendor ne ise pehle se register nahi kiya hona chahiye.

37
00:03:05.249 --> 00:03:10.540
Agar vendor ko already registered wala message dikhe, toh ho sakta hai usne pehle

38
00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:15.571
Apply kiya ho, isliye naya kuch banane se pehle admin panel check kar lijiye.

39
00:03:51.767 --> 00:03:57.543
Step two hai authorised signatory. Ye wo person hai jo business ki taraf se sign kar

40
00:03:57.543 --> 00:03:58.231
Sakta hai.

41
00:03:58.681 --> 00:04:02.457
Unka poora naam, bilkul waise jaise PAN card pe hai.

42
00:04:02.907 --> 00:04:06.086
Unka designation, jaise director ya owner.

43
00:04:06.536 --> 00:04:08.989
Unka Aadhaar aur personal PAN.

44
00:04:09.439 --> 00:04:10.804
Ek mobile number.

45
00:04:11.254 --> 00:04:16.902
Aur ek email. Yahi email vendor ka login banta hai, isliye ye aisa email hona

46
00:04:16.902 --> 00:04:20.129
Chahiye jo Oribrix pe pehle use nahi hua ho.

47
00:04:22.533 --> 00:04:25.178
Chaliye ise live demo mein dekhte hain.

48
00:04:28.967 --> 00:04:34.554
Ab step two. Signatory ka naam PAN ke hisaab se daala gaya hai, aur designation,

49
00:04:34.554 --> 00:04:35.602
Yahan Director.

50
00:04:46.567 --> 00:04:50.194
Phir Aadhaar number, personal PAN, aur mobile number.

51
00:05:04.167 --> 00:05:09.913
Aakhir mein email. Demo mein team ko kayi emails try karne pade, kyunki har ek pehle

52
00:05:09.913 --> 00:05:12.444
Se kisi login mein use ho chuka thaa.

53
00:05:20.967 --> 00:05:26.069
Step three hai banking. Yahin pe Oribrix vendor ke payouts bhejta hai, isliye ise

54
00:05:26.069 --> 00:05:30.982
Dhyaan se check kiya jaata hai. Account number nine se eighteen digits ka hona

55
00:05:30.982 --> 00:05:34.069
Chahiye, aur kuch banks ki length fixed hoti hai.

56
00:05:34.069 --> 00:05:38.100
Demo mein Bank of Baroda ne exactly fourteen digits accept kiye.

57
00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:43.328
IFSC code eleven characters ka hota hai, aur uska fifth character hamesha zero hota

58
00:05:43.328 --> 00:05:43.580
Hai.

59
00:06:28.133 --> 00:06:30.778
Chaliye ise live demo mein dekhte hain.

60
00:06:35.367 --> 00:06:38.887
Ye raha banking step. Pehle account holder ka naama.

61
00:06:48.167 --> 00:06:53.425
Phir list mein se bank chuna jaata hai. Bank of Baroda select kiya gaya, aur account

62
00:06:53.425 --> 00:06:54.802
Number type kiya gaya.

63
00:07:08.167 --> 00:07:11.530
Ab Canara Bank try kiya gaya. IFSC box dekhiye.

64
00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:16.252
Message bol raha hai ki IFSC ka fifth character zero hona chahiye.

65
00:07:26.567 --> 00:07:30.325
Branch aur account type ke saath ye step poora hota hai.

66
00:07:30.325 --> 00:07:35.895
Tip: vendors ko boliye ki cancelled cheque paas rakhein, usme ye saari details hoti

67
00:07:35.895 --> 00:07:36.231
Hain.

68
00:07:41.767 --> 00:07:47.102
Step four hai warehouse. KYC ke liye har vendor ko ek asli, physical warehouse

69
00:07:47.102 --> 00:07:50.386
Dikhana hota hai. Yahin se orders pick up honge.

70
00:07:50.836 --> 00:07:54.505
Warehouse ka naam, aur storage capacity square feet men.

71
00:07:54.955 --> 00:07:58.549
Map pe exact location, Locate me ya search box se.

72
00:07:58.549 --> 00:08:01.568
Dhyaan rakhiye ki pin sahi building pe ho.

73
00:08:02.018 --> 00:08:03.917
Opening aur closing time.

74
00:08:04.367 --> 00:08:08.271
Kaun kaun si vehicles is warehouse tak pahunch sakti hain.

75
00:08:08.721 --> 00:08:13.606
KYC approval ke baad vendor aur warehouses add kar sakta hai.

76
00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:21.006
Vehicle types kyun zaroori hain? Kyunki har gali mein bada truck nahi ghus sakta.

77
00:08:21.006 --> 00:08:21.995
Ye options hain.

78
00:08:22.445 --> 00:08:26.413
Mini truck ya pickup, chhote loads aur tang galiyon ke liye.

79
00:08:26.863 --> 00:08:28.548
Light commercial vehicles.

80
00:08:28.998 --> 00:08:30.875
Medium commercial vehicles.

81
00:08:31.325 --> 00:08:35.293
Heavy commercial vehicles, chaudi roads pe bulk loads ke liye.

82
00:08:35.743 --> 00:08:40.976
Aur trailers and containers. Sirf wahi vehicles tick kijiye jo sach mein warehouse

83
00:08:40.976 --> 00:08:42.954
Ke gate tak pahunch sakti hain.

84
00:08:45.367 --> 00:08:48.012
Chaliye ise live demo mein dekhte hain.

85
00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:57.037
Ye hai step four. Pehle warehouse ka naam aur storage capacity.

86
00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:12.493
Locate me current location dhoondh leta hai, ya aap search karke pin drag kar sakte

87
00:09:12.493 --> 00:09:12.824
Hain.

88
00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:33.048
Phir timings, aur allowed vehicles ki list: mini truck, LCV, MCV, HCV, aur trailers.

89
00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:52.270
Demo mein warehouse ka naam Central City rakha gaya, ten thousand square feet

90
00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.571
Capacity ke saatha.

91
00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:11.203
Step five hai categories. Isse tay hota hai ki vendor kaun se products bech paayega.

92
00:10:11.653 --> 00:10:16.671
Standard categories list mein se chuni jaati hain: tiles, plumbing, electrical,

93
00:10:16.671 --> 00:10:20.101
Tools, roofing, safety equipment, concrete aur bricks.

94
00:10:20.551 --> 00:10:25.762
Agar kuch missing hai, toh vendor Other pe click karke naam type karta hai aur ek

95
00:10:25.762 --> 00:10:30.972
Image upload karta hai. Custom category admin ke paas approval ke liye jaati hai.

96
00:10:30.972 --> 00:10:35.926
Aur dhyaan rakhiye: kuch categories ke liye brand authorisation documents bhi

97
00:10:35.926 --> 00:10:37.084
Chahiye hote hain.

98
00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.145
Chaliye ise live demo mein dekhte hain.

99
00:10:46.733 --> 00:10:51.938
Ye rahe category cards. Concrete, bricks aur safety equipment select kiye gaye hain.

100
00:11:02.733 --> 00:11:08.130
Ab Other pe click kiya. Ek chhoti window category ka naam aur image maang rahi hai.

101
00:11:23.533 --> 00:11:28.359
Outdoor sports ab ek private custom category ki tarah dikh rahi hai.

102
00:11:28.359 --> 00:11:30.701
Ye admin approval ka wait karegi.

103
00:11:40.333 --> 00:11:44.856
Step six hai documents. Chaar mandatory hain aur chaar optional.

104
00:11:45.306 --> 00:11:51.134
Mandatory hain GST certificate, business PAN, cancelled cheque, aur owner ka

105
00:11:51.134 --> 00:11:54.586
Aadhaar. Inke bina KYC confirm nahi ho sakta.

106
00:11:55.036 --> 00:12:00.917
Optional hain trade licence, Oribrix agreement, ISO nine thousand one certificate,

107
00:12:00.917 --> 00:12:05.937
Aur MSME ya Udyam registration. Ye baad mein bhi upload ho sakte hain.

108
00:12:08.333 --> 00:12:10.978
Chaliye ise live demo mein dekhte hain.

109
00:12:15.567 --> 00:12:21.001
Ye documents step hai. Har row mein upload button hai, aur har file encrypted rehti

110
00:12:21.001 --> 00:12:21.263
Hai.

111
00:12:36.367 --> 00:12:41.230
Upload hui files selected dikhti hain, view aur replace option ke saatha.

112
00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:43.962
Optional rows pe optional likha hota hai.

113
00:12:56.367 --> 00:13:02.242
Confirm KYC ke baad documents received dikhte hain, aur status In review ho jaata

114
00:13:02.242 --> 00:13:02.532
Hai.

115
00:13:13.167 --> 00:13:19.183
Submit karne ke baad vendor is KYC and compliance control center pe pahunchta hai.

116
00:13:19.633 --> 00:13:23.004
Yahan dikhta hai ki kitne documents upload hue,

117
00:13:23.454 --> 00:13:27.912
Verification status, jo admin ke action tak In review rehta hai,

118
00:13:28.362 --> 00:13:33.717
Aur approval progress. Approval usually twenty four hours ke andar ho jaata hai.

119
00:13:36.133 --> 00:13:41.988
Ye wo mistakes hain jo sabse zyada hoti hain. Vendors ko inse bachaiye, toh approval

120
00:13:41.988 --> 00:13:43.173
Bahut jaldi hoga.

121
00:13:43.623 --> 00:13:47.548
Business name, GST certificate se match nahi karta.

122
00:13:47.998 --> 00:13:51.689
Login email pehle se Oribrix pe use ho chuka hai.

123
00:13:52.139 --> 00:13:55.702
Galat IFSC code, ya account number ki galat length.

124
00:13:56.152 --> 00:13:59.053
Warehouse ka pin galat building pe laga hai.

125
00:13:59.503 --> 00:14:04.858
Aur dhundhli ya kati hui document photos. Clear scans ya PDFs maangiye.

126
00:14:07.267 --> 00:14:13.171
Quick check. Ek vendor ne IFSC code type kiya, H D F C one zero zero zero one two

127
00:14:13.171 --> 00:14:16.888
Three. Isme galat kya hai? Ek second rukke sochiye.

128
00:14:20.838 --> 00:14:24.486
Answer: IFSC ka fifth character zero hona chahiye.

129
00:14:24.486 --> 00:14:28.134
Yahan wo one hai, isliye form ise reject kar dega.

130
00:14:30.933 --> 00:14:33.493
Chaliye module two ko sum up karte hain.

131
00:14:33.943 --> 00:14:39.376
Form mein chhah steps hain: business, signatory, banking, warehouse, categories, aur

132
00:14:39.376 --> 00:14:40.023
Documents.

133
00:14:40.473 --> 00:14:46.318
GSTIN valid hona chahiye, aur pehle se registered nahi hona chahiye.

134
00:14:46.768 --> 00:14:51.611
Login email naya hona chahiye, aur bank details validate hoti hain.

135
00:14:52.061 --> 00:14:55.240
Custom categories ko admin approval chahiye.

136
00:14:55.690 --> 00:15:00.527
Aur KYC confirm karne se pehle charon mandatory documents chahiye.

137
00:15:00.527 --> 00:15:06.464
Agle module mein hum doosri side jaayenge aur dekhenge ki admin vendor ko approve

138
00:15:06.464 --> 00:15:07.636
Kaise karta hai.

139
00:15:10.033 --> 00:15:15.985
Module 2 yahin khatam hota hai. Agla hai module 3: Admin: approving KYC.
